'''Squirtgun Saki''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]] gacha event. Added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]], she is a summer variant of [[Sharpshooter Saki (Uber Rare Cat)|Sharpshooter Saki]] who only targets [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] and either [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] or [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies depending on her form. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]] gains [[Strong Against|Strong]] against Floating and Angel enemies.

