==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Aquabuster Saki''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Aquablaster Saki''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Use her as you would a regular sniper. Make sure you spawn meatshields so nothing enters her blindspot, and don't let her take too much damage due to her measly health.

A mistimed use of the regular Cat Cannon can cause this unit to dash forward and take damage, so it's important to wait for her to be doing an attack animation before firing.

Compared to regular Saki, she has the same stats, except for the target, which makes her more versatile in terms of usages, but when it comes to [[Cheese|cheesing]], there is virtually no difference to her regular version.

==='''True Form'''===
She still only targets Angel and Floating enemies, just like her evolved form, but she is now '''strong''' against them. This means that her already impressive 7.5k DPS at level 30 jumps to a staggering 13.6k DPS just like that, with each individual hit dealing over 122k damage. While she does retain her large blindspot, the right support can minimize this problem, just like with her other forms. Plus, she still does have an amazing 600 standing range and 300 piercing range to help her hit crowds of enemies incredibly hard.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Super-Backliner}}

